frac{16-4\\text{i}}{17}=\\left(\\frac{16}{17}\\right)+\\left(-\\frac{4}{17}\\right)\\,\\text{i}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299514 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a3967e5d-bd56-552a-a50b-4ae2cfedd2b0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{12}{13}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298269}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a3967e5d-bd56-552a-a50b-4ae2cfedd2b0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{12}{13}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298269} :answer-field/id #uuid "229bd42f-094d-5c26-aa74-2cfd09475a82" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298751} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6183ff9e-d7b9-5062-92f0-8b113af01c98" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{8}{13}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297966}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6183ff9e-d7b9-5062-92f0-8b113af01c98" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{8}{13}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297966} :answer-field/id #uuid "6c3a771b-9ef6-5d78-bbf8-9abdf22046a7" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298997}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "ba56fc62-b444-562e-b35b-e81f43e6868a" :question/math-academy-id "q-316855" :question/problem "Evaluate the expression below, expressing your answer in the form $a+b\\text{i},$ where $a$ and $b$ are real numbers.\n\n$\\frac{4\\text{i}}{-2-3\\text{i}}=($ {{field-1}} \n$)\\,+\\,($\n{{field-2}}\n$)\\,\\text{i}$" :question/worked-solution "The denominator is $-2-3\\text{i}$ and its conjugate is $-2+3\\text{i}.$ We multiply both the numerator and the denominator by $-2+3\\text{i},$ so that the denominator turns into a real number:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{4\\text{i}}{-2-3\\text{i}} & =\\frac{4\\text{i}}{-2-3\\text{i}}\\cdot \\frac{-2+3\\text{i}}{-2+3\\text{i}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-8\\text{i}+12{\\text{i}}^{2}}{(-2)^{2}-(3\\text{i})^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-8\\text{i}+12(-1)}{4-(-9)} \\\\  & =\\frac{-12-8\\text{i}}{13}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow that the denominator is a real number, we can write the complex number in the form $a+b\\text{i}:$\n\n$$\n\\frac{-12-8\\text{i}}{13}=\\left(-\\frac{12}{13}\\right)+\\left(-\\frac{8}{13}\\right)\\,\\text{i}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299515 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5dd55997-2221-58cf-bf52-3ed914a635da" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{5}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297947}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5dd55997-2221-58cf-bf52-3ed914a635da" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{5}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297947} :answer-field/id #uuid "19de7164-d828-50ef-9223-77cb80e86e70" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298729} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c32ab416-d4f8-5b72-8379-5fecc922c0a2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{6}{5}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298409}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c32ab416-d4f8-5b72-8379-5fecc922c0a2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{6}{5}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298409} :answer-field/id #uuid "59cc02f9-d9d0-5907-9b19-61ea0f7d051d" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298945}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "32c0f629-f924-5897-bd61-01d97956df2c" :question/math-academy-id "q-316861" :question/problem "Evaluate the expression below, expressing your answer in the form $a+b\\text{i},$ where $a$ and $b$ are real numbers.\n\n$\\frac{3}{1+2\\text{i}}=($\n{{field-1}} \n$)\\,+\\,($\n{{field-2}}\n$)\\,\\text{i}$" :question/worked-solution "The denominator is $1+2\\text{i}$ and its conjugate is $1-2\\text{i}.$ We multiply both the numerator and the denominator by $1-2\\text{i},$ so that the denominator turns into a real number:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3}{1+2\\text{i}} & =\\frac{3}{1+2\\text{i}}\\cdot \\frac{1-2\\text{i}}{1-2\\text{i}} \\\\  & =\\frac{3(1-2\\text{i})}{{1}^{2}-(2\\text{i})^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{3-6\\text{i}}{1-(-4)} \\\\  & =\\frac{3-6\\text{i}}{5}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow that the denominator is a real number, we can write the complex number in the form $a+b\\text{i}:$\n\n$$\n\\frac{3-6\\text{i}}{5}=\\left(\\frac{3}{5}\\right)+\\left(-\\frac{6}{5}\\right)\\,\\text{i}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299516 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f28b52c3-8033-5e97-85c7-3fde6af461fc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{12}{13}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298580}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f28b52c3-8033-5e97-85c7-3fde6af461fc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{12}{13}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298580} :answer-field/id #uuid "bb8e26ae-f17e-551c-ad83-955e7c687c70" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299272} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "bb7cd9e6-e620-5eaf-9296-9b4fbbb56dd5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{18}{13}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298369}] :answer-field/co