ys at $y=0.$\n\n![](images/4d/4d60dc4fe52cd717370ae1eeb28dd35b0c3c8e4a4e69ff088b16e56c03be5735.png)\n\n- Then, reflect it on the $x$-axis to give $y=-{\\left(\\frac{1}{3}\\right)}^{x-2}.$ The point $(2,1)$ moves to $(2,-1)$ and the horizontal asymptote stays at $y=0.$\n\n![](images/e4/e4b042273bfb3a6640e57c75eff3058dd177bc2d75dfdf312160a4a6c9a9de53.png)"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299655 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "441acd52-7ff9-5b03-80ab-80021fe6017d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/d4/d419a8f0624726d2615088a742c3505ab1526bd6f56f54b038c268232d82b1a3.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297829} {:answer/id #uuid "4d20d207-e9c0-5f11-abad-1ee4e2dced5c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/48/48c7b75fe6bb869cec6a6686dbf400a0b477c8b905caab8f0c7420d9730e88e4.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297869} {:answer/id #uuid "6c368934-d37d-52ca-b551-1012ca0b8081" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/97/97db94742d00b1104491c22692054d1810bf7efb5b3c1d109f6647fb6f9b5eb4.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298019} {:answer/id #uuid "8bef2f9a-8c3f-52cf-8a8c-77f4a1944698" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/8d/8d40c54a0f94ec23ff137fdc02eee3f6aec6f8a075fe79c22792faf4315dabac.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298160} {:answer/id #uuid "df3338c3-484d-5c5f-956b-3343acdbdfa9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/b8/b8d956bef289485a18981fe5a7290ff2e8985f810a27b3fcac6394ff3457929c.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298507}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "441acd52-7ff9-5b03-80ab-80021fe6017d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/d4/d419a8f0624726d2615088a742c3505ab1526bd6f56f54b038c268232d82b1a3.png" :db/id #edb/ref 